    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Lydon Farrell Property are delighted to present this exceptional family home to the market. This large family home was built and designed with a separate living accommodation suitable for extended family members. The property is presented in excellent condition throughout and is situated on 0.90 acres of landscaped gardens in the popular area of Wilkinstown, just outside Navan Town Centre. The house offers countryside living while convenient to all local amenities.\r\n\r\nThis family home has been exceptionally well maintained by the current owners and is set out with an entrance hall, living room, lounge, kitchen/dining room, guest w.c, utility room and double bedroom on the ground floor.  The first floor comprises four well-proportioned bedrooms, including a master bedroom with ensuite and walk in wardrobe and main family bathroom. \r\n\r\nAlso, included in the sale is a self contained residential unit that is interconnected with the house and is suitable for a variety of purposes. The accommodation is set out as a utility room, bathroom, single bedroom and an open plan kitchen/living/dining area on the ground floor. The first floor consist of an open space suitable and a double bedroom.\r\n\r\nDemailestown, Wilkinstown, offers the best of rural living while being located close to schools, shops and local sporting facilities such as Wolfe Tonnes GAA Club. The property is ideally located within easy driving distance of Navan Town Centre."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Large Family home designed with separate living accommodation\r\nThis home qualifies for a green mortgage\r\nSituated on a mature 0.9 acre site\r\nPresented to the market is very condition\r\nLocated close to local amenities and only 10km to Navan"
      },
